# Deployment-specific hygiene patterns — one JavaScript regex per line.
#
# Copy to `.leak-patterns` (gitignored) and add the terms that are private to
# YOUR deployment: internal project names, personal forms of address, private
# hostnames, ticket-prefix conventions.
#
#   cp .leak-patterns.example .leak-patterns
#   node scripts/check-repo-hygiene.mjs . --lib --patterns-file .leak-patterns
#
# These deliberately do NOT live in the repository: a committed list of the
# terms to avoid is itself the thing you are trying to keep private.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Invalid regexes are skipped with a warning.

# --- examples (uncomment and edit) ---
# AcmeInternalPlatform
# sir|madam        # personal forms of address
# /srv/private/    # private host paths
